  "entity_type": "person",
  "description": "Summer 2026 kicked off with Miss Monique’s appearance on the cover of DJ Mag Ibiza, in advance of her 17-week residency at Hï Ibiza. Every Thursday night in the Club Room she was joined by special guests and artists from her Siona Records world. She appeared at [UNVRS] a few times too, including a memorable performance with global pop superstar Robbie Williams around their joint ‘Beauty In Us’ single.\n\nHer collab with Kapuchon and GLZ, ‘Hot Sauce’, topped Beatport’s Melodic House & Techno chart for four weeks, and she debuted her concept show, BIORHYTHM, on Tomorrowland’s Freedom Stage, with more shows to come.",
